  "title": "Corn and Zucchini Pancakes",
  "description": "These savory corn and zucchini pancakes are made with fresh corn and zucchini and will appeal to even the pickiest of eaters.",
  "authors": [
    "Anne Talbot-Kleeman"
  ],
